    "description": "<p><strong>EARTH DRAGON</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Size</strong> Medium</p>\n<p><strong>Level</strong> 4 (<strong>EL</strong> 3); <strong>DC</strong> 18</p>\n<p><strong>Initiative</strong> +20</p>\n<p><strong>Speed</strong> 30 feet; Burrow 20; Climb 30</p>\n<p><strong>Senses</strong> Darkvision 55’, Nightvision 110’, Scent 30’</p>\n<p><strong>Languages</strong> Glimbol, Low Tongue, Wyrmish</p>\n<p><strong>ABILITY SCORES</strong> <strong>STR</strong> +3, <strong>CON</strong> +1, <strong>DEX</strong> +3, <strong>INT</strong> +1, <strong>WIS</strong> +1, <strong>CHA</strong> +2</p>\n<p><strong>SKILLS</strong> Acrobatics +6(1), Arcana +6(3), Athletics +9(4), Culture +5(2) Deception +6(2), Diplomacy +6(2), Intimidate +5(1), Meditation +4(1), Mental Focus +7(4), Nature +4(1), Perception +7(4), Power Manipulation +7(4), Sense Motive +6(3), Stealth +5(2), Survival +5(2)</p>\n<p><strong>DEFENCE</strong><br>DB +19 (Base +14; Other +2; Stat +3); DR 6<br>Fort +12, Ref +12, Will +10<br>HP 82; Immunity acid, paralysis, sleep</p>\n<p><strong>FEATS/SPECIAL</strong> Alertness, Great Fortitude</p>\n<p><strong>Earth Dragon Breath</strong> 2 AP (acid, arcane, focus, invocation, save)<br>The dragon breathes a 30-foot line of acid that inflicts 4d8 acid damage. The breath weapon has the focus trait, and any targets may make a basic Reflex save to avoid damage.</p>\n<p><strong>ATTACKS</strong><br>Bite +9 (finesse) 1d8+3 piercing plus 1d6 acid<br>Claw +9 (agile, finesse, versatile - p) 1d6+3 slashing</p>\n<p><strong>MAGIC</strong><br>A cave dragon is a High Magic caster.<br>CL 1; Spellcraft +6; PP 18<br>Spells 4 x Cantrip, 4 additional spells (max PP 2).</p>\n<p><strong>SPECIAL ABILITIES BY LEVEL</strong> 6: Wild Stride; 8: Draconic Assault; 10: Frightful Aura; 12: Wing Buffet; 14: Slowing Breath; 16: Caustic Blood; 18: Caustic Strikes; 20: Draconic Shifting</p>\n<p><em>An earth dragon is a massive serpentine creature associated with the power of the earth and often depicted with rocky, earth-toned scales.</em></p>\n<p><em>Automated:</em> hatched by Dragon Tamer at level 4, with the skill ranks printed (B10-7), the feats printed (each counting as a pick made), its languages, immunities and weakness. The breath is 4d8 at 4 and a die a level after (C5), a Focus ability with a basic Reflex save at the creature DC; it grows as a line with the table. Its specials arrive by its own level from the system's Creature Codex. Its DB is the printed block's (Graham, 28 October 2026): the system's creature rule, half its level as an other bonus and its class bonus − 2 as a status bonus. Its natural attacks follow the system's one size ladder (B10-10). It has wings but does not fly (B10-4).</p>",
